<view class="page"><view class="title">选一家小店，好好吃饭。</view><view class="subtitle">扫码直达对应商家，或在这里选择小店。无需注册账号。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{stores}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open">进店点餐</button></view></view><view class="small" wx:if="{{!stores.length}}">暂时没有已发布菜单的小店。</view><button bindtap="orders">查看我的订单</button></view>
